Usingunwrap

Theunwrapfunction must not be used in any code.
Instead, proper error handling like above should be used, unless there is a valid reason to useexpectdescribed below.
Usingunwrap_or,unwrap_or_defaultorunwrap_or_elseis allowed because these functions will not panic.

Theexpectfunction can be used when external factors cannot influence whether a panic will happen. For example, when compiling regular expressions inside const/static environments.
For such cases code must useexpectinstead ofunwrapto provide additional context for why a particular piece of code should never fail.

